// Asset validation for the dedicated-server sample (book agents/asset-validators.md). `regia package`
// fails on findings here (ADR-4908). The game's code loads its data tables by name, so the tables are
// roots next to the levels; without this the orphan check flags them.
(
    format_version: 1,
    roots: ["assets/levels/**", "assets/data/**"],
)
